            <li><strong>Cross-Posting to TikTok &amp; YouTube Shorts:</strong> Videos compressed to 1080×1920 at 1.8 to 2.5 Mbps using our tool are 100% compliant with TikTok and YouTube Shorts upload specifications. You can create one universal master clip and publish it across all three platforms without re-rendering.</li>
